control: Every subject is masked and every sender classified before the message reaches the index
removes: every message reaches the index with its sender classified normal
packages: ./core/index ./backfill/internal/pass1 ./sync/internal/tick
tests: TestDecide TestDecideFailsClosed TestAKilledRunResumesFromItsCheckpoint TestAPassIndexesTheWholeMailbox TestATickAppliesTheChangesSinceItsCursor
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

